[20.467552, "o", "\u001b[0m\r\n> build · deepseek-v4.1-flash\r\n"]
[20.909051, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mid; cat /etc/os-release 2>/dev/null | head -5; command -v setfacl getfacl setquota 2>/dev/null; getent group research; getent passwd alice bob\r\nuid=0(root) gid=0(root) groups=0(root)\r\nPRETTY_NAME=\"Ubuntu 24.04.2 LTS\"\r\nNAME=\"Ubuntu\"\r\nVERSION_ID=\"24.04\"\r\nVERSION=\"24.04.2 LTS (Noble Numbat)\"\r\nVERSION_CODENAME=noble\r\n/usr/bin/setfacl\r\n/usr/bin/getfacl\r\nresearch:x:1001:alice,bob\r\nalice:x:1001:1002::/home/alice:/bin/bash\r\nbob:x:1002:1003::/home/bob:/bin/bash\r\n"]
[22.042376, "o", "> build · deepseek-v4.1-flash\r\n"]
[22.44639, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mls -ld /srv /srv/shared 2>&1; getfacl -p /srv/shared 2>&1; findmnt -T /srv/shared -o TARGET,FSTYPE,OPTIONS 2>&1\r\nls: cannot access '/srv/shared': No such file or directory\r\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 root root 4096 Apr  4  2025 /srv\r\ngetfacl: /srv/shared: No such file or directory\r\n"]
[23.354104, "o", "> build · deepseek-v4.1-flash\r\n"]
[24.003892, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mmkdir -p /srv/shared && chgrp research /srv/shared && chmod 2770 /srv/shared && setfacl -m u::rwx,g::rwx,g:research:rwx,o::---,m::rwx /srv/shared && setfacl -m u:alice:rwx,u:bob:rwx /srv/shared && setfacl -d -m u::rwx,g::rwx,g:research:rwx,o::---,m::rwx /srv/shared && setfacl -d -m u:alice:rwx,u:bob:rwx /srv/shared && ls -ld /srv/shared && getfacl /srv/shared\r\ndrwxrws---+ 2 root research 4096 Nov  1 03:24 /srv/shared\r\ngetfacl: Removing leading '/' from absolute path names\r\n# file: srv/shared\r\n# owner: root\r\n# group: research\r\n# flags: -s-\r\nuser::rwx\r\nuser:alice:rwx\r\nuser:bob:rwx\r\ngroup::rwx\r\ngroup:research:rwx\r\nmask::rwx\r\nother::---\r\ndefault:user::rwx\r\ndefault:user:alice:rwx\r\ndefault:user:bob:rwx\r\ndefault:group::rwx\r\ndefault:group:research:rwx\r\ndefault:mask::rwx\r\ndefault:other::---\r\n"]
[25.162243, "o", "> build · deepseek-v4.1-flash\r\n"]
[26.44184, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mcd /srv/shared && mkdir _verify && touch _verify/a.txt && getfacl -p _verify _verify/a.txt && ls -ld _verify _verify/a.txt; cd /; rm -rf /srv/shared/_verify; echo '--- final ---'; ls -la /srv/shared; getfacl -p /srv/shared\r\n# file: _verify\r\n# owner: root\r\n# group: research\r\n# flags: -s-\r\nuser::rwx\r\nuser:alice:rwx\r\nuser:bob:rwx\r\ngroup::rwx\r\ngroup:research:rwx\r\nmask::rwx\r\nother::---\r\ndefault:user::rwx\r\ndefault:user:alice:rwx\r\ndefault:user:bob:rwx\r\ndefault:group::rwx\r\ndefault:group:research:rwx\r\ndefault:mask::rwx\r\ndefault:other::---\r\n\r\n# file: _verify/a.txt\r\n# owner: root\r\n# group: research\r\nuser::rw-\r\nuser:alice:rwx\t#effective:rw-\r\nuser:bob:rwx\t#effective:rw-\r\ngroup::rwx\t#effective:rw-\r\ngroup:research:rwx\t#effective:rw-\r\nmask::rw-\r\nother::---\r\n\r\ndrwxrws---+ 2 root research 4096 Nov  1 03:24 _verify\r\n-rw-rw----+ 1 root research    0 Nov  1 03:24 _verify/a.txt\r\n--- final ---\r\ntotal 12\r\ndrwxrws---+ 2 root research 4096 Nov  1 03:24 .\r\ndrwxr-xr-x  1 root root     4096 Nov  1 03:24 ..\r\n# file: /srv/shared\r\n# owner: root\r\n# group: research\r\n# flags: -s-\r\nuser::rwx\r\nuser:alice:rwx\r\nuser:bob:rwx\r\ngroup::rwx\r\ngroup:research:rwx\r\nmask::rwx\r\nother::---\r\ndefault:user::rwx\r\ndefault:user:alice:rwx\r\ndefault:user:bob:rwx\r\ndefault:group::rwx\r\ndefault:group:research:rwx\r\ndefault:mask::rwx\r\ndefault:other::---\r\n"]
[27.776914, "o", "> build · deepseek-v4.1-flash\r\n"]
[28.943837, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mfor u in alice bob nobody; do if su -s /bin/sh \"$u\" -c 'test -rx /srv/shared && test -w /srv/shared' 2>/dev/null; then echo \"$u: access OK\"; else echo \"$u: denied\"; fi; done; ls -la /srv/shared\r\nalice: denied\r\nbob: denied\r\nnobody: denied\r\ntotal 12\r\ndrwxrws---+ 2 root research 4096 Nov  1 03:24 .\r\ndrwxr-xr-x  1 root root     4096 Nov  1 03:24 ..\r\n"]
[30.179367, "o", "> build · deepseek-v4.1-flash\r\n"]
[30.672072, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0msu -s /bin/sh alice -c 'id; ls -ld /srv/shared; test -rx /srv/shared && echo RX_OK; test -w /srv/shared && echo W_OK' ; echo \"exit=$?\"\r\nuid=1001(alice) gid=1002(alice) groups=1002(alice),1001(research)\r\ndrwxrws---+ 2 root research 4096 Nov  1 03:24 /srv/shared\r\nW_OK\r\nsh: 1: test: -rx: unexpected operator\r\nexit=0\r\n"]
[32.886425, "o", "> build · deepseek-v4.1-flash\r\n"]
[33.450769, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mfor u in alice bob nobody; do su -s /bin/sh \"$u\" -c 'test -r /srv/shared && test -x /srv/shared && test -w /srv/shared' 2>/dev/null && echo \"$u: rwx OK\" || echo \"$u: denied\"; done\r\nalice: rwx OK\r\nbob: rwx OK\r\nnobody: denied\r\n"]
[34.720687, "o", "> build · deepseek-v4.1-flash\r\n"]
[36.087762, "o", "Done. `/srv/shared` is configured and verified.\r\n\r\n**Final state**\r\n\r\n```\r\ndrwxrws---+  root:research  /srv/shared\r\n```\r\n\r\n**ACL (access + default)**\r\n\r\n```\r\nuser::rwx\r\nuser:alice:rwx\r\nuser:bob:rwx\r\ngroup::rwx\r\ngroup:research:rwx\r\nmask::rwx\r\nother::---\r\ndefault:user::rwx\r\ndefault:user:alice:rwx\r\ndefault:user:bob:rwx\r\ndefault:group::rwx\r\ndefault:group:research:rwx\r\ndefault:mask::rwx\r\ndefault:other::---\r\n```\r\n\r\n**What was done**\r\n- Created `/srv/shared`, group `research`, mode `2770` (setgid set).\r\n- Applied access ACLs for `research`, `alice`, `bob` (rwx), others none, with `mask::rwx`.\r\n- Applied matching default ACLs for inheritance.\r\n- Verified inheritance with a temporary subdirectory/file: both inherited `u:alice:rwx`, `u:bob:rwx`, `g:research:rwx`, `mask`, and `other::---`, and the subdirectory kept setgid.\r\n- Removed all verification artifacts, so the directory is empty.\r\n\r\n**Access check**\r\n- `alice`: rwx OK\r\n- `bob`: rwx OK\r\n- `nobody`: denied\r\n\r\nNo files remain in `/srv/shared` for the tests to run cleanly.\r\n"]
